The dataset data/tnbc_metabric.rda is a processed subset of the METABRIC breast cancer
study (brca_metabric) obtained from cBioPortal for Cancer Genomics:
https://www.cbioportal.org/study/summary?id=brca_metabric

cBioPortal states that, unless otherwise noted, its data are available under the ODC Open
Database License (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/), with attribution to the
original studies. This subset is shared under the same licence. See ?tnbc_metabric for the
processing and the publications to cite.
